## Cool-down
Cool-down, three minutes. Easy figure of eight, then the stretches as I call them.
+0:00.5 [countdown]
--- 3:00
0:00 [go]
3% Nice and easy. Breathe out.
25% Ball down. Calf stretch, left leg back.
37% Switch legs.
50% Hip stretch. Long lunge, left leg back.
62% Switch legs.
75% Shoulder stretch. Left arm across.
87% Switch arms.
---
[stop]
